## [E2] which calls reach TransactionInterceptor
| case | expected | actual | match | tx name |
|---|---|---|---|---|
| constructor(init)                  | false    | false    | true  | - |
| @PostConstruct → own @Transactional | true     | false    | false | - |
| external → proxy                   | true     | true     | true  | tx |
| self-invocation this.tx()          | true     | false    | false | - |
| self field → proxy                 | true     | true     | true  | tx |
| private @Transactional             | false    | false    | true  | - |
| protected @Transactional           | false    | true     | false | protectedTx |
| final @Transactional               | false    | false    | true  | - |

